  "_minClaudeVersionNote": "Floor = the lowest claude version measured on a fleet host in XACA-1599-001 (M1Mini 2.1.267; M1Pro was upgraded to 2.1.310). `kb-sync-plugins check --host --probe` is the per-host behavioural probe: it asks a `claude -p` session for the L1 marker and exits 3 when it cannot verify. Record each host's probe result (host, claude version, date, verdict) in kanban/plans/XACA-1599/XACA-1599_006_probe_results.md at rollout. Raise the floor only if a host at the floor fails the probe.",
