    "_note": "L1 managed policy, rendered by `kb-sync-plugins managed-policy --print` into managed-settings.d/50-aiteamforge.json. Bump `revision` with every change: it is the AITEAMFORGE_MANAGED_POLICY marker the probe looks for. L1 only blocks (false); it never force-enables a plugin.",
